# Copy to .dev.vars for local adapter work. Never commit real values.
# Production APP_URL is a wrangler var (https://youbid.lol).
# Production secrets: wrangler secret put OWNER_COOKIE_SECRET|STRIPE_SECRET_KEY|STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# Local may stay empty. Production live keys: wrangler secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY (sk_live_) and STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET (whsec_).
# No Dashboard Product catalog — Checkout uses price_data.unit_amount.
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"
OWNER_COOKIE_SECRET="youbid-local-owner-cookie-secret"
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=""
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
TURNSTILE_SECRET=""
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=""
